{
 "about": "Order of the Bangla Picture This deck, from what a newcomer to Bangladesh needs first to what is most specialised. scripts/build_web.py and scripts/deck_order.py put deck-data.js in this order. New cards are placed by the deck_tier (and optional deck_after) in their card.json; see DECK_ORDER.md.",
 "tiers": {
  "1": "First days: greetings, replies, pointing, numbers 1-12, prices, food and water, toilet, rickshaw, family, body, pain, urgent help",
  "2": "First weeks: home, meals and tea, market produce, time, colours and basic descriptions, family circle, medicine, shops, numbers to 30",
  "3": "First month: daily life at home, cooking, clothing, weather, getting around, body detail, household problems, festivals",
  "4": "Settling in: wider vocabulary for markets, crafts, repairs, nature, customs and describing things in detail",
  "5": "Enrichment: specialist, regional or occasional vocabulary"
 },
